{"obsah":"<p>We held the first two classic camps of our Bikeskills project, once again split into female bikers (Saturday) and male bikers (Sunday). Surprisingly, once again more women came, and thanks to the weather too it turned into a relaxed day on the bike, where the women made progress on everything we came across, including steps, benches and things they probably wouldn't ride on their own. There were fewer men, and all the more exhausted they were. Fewer riders, more riding :) All under the guidance of Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček and Katarína Tóthová. We hope the riders found a new perspective on riding and perhaps goals for the future.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F20240427_100050_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F20240427_100050_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246029\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F20240427_102639_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F20240427_102639_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246031\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F20240427_102854_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F20240427_102854_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246030\"/></a></figure>\n\n<fi